# .claude is a link to a directory outside the project
$ skills project-register --project-root <WORLD>/project --candidate procedural/candidates/repeated-success/tidy-worktree --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml <WORLD>/drafts/tidy/SKILL.md
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: project-register: destination ".claude/skills/tidy-worktree": escapes the project root through a symlink

--- state of project ---
.claude -> ../outside

--- state of outside ---
(empty)

# the directory of the skill is a link to one outside
$ skills project-register --project-root <WORLD>/project --candidate procedural/candidates/repeated-success/tidy-worktree --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml <WORLD>/drafts/tidy/SKILL.md
exit: 1
